## Criteria key reference

| Key | Description                                                                           | Signal |
|-----|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|--------|
| `THIN_ACCOUNT_0` | Author has 0–1 total reviews on Google Maps                                           | fake |
| `THIN_ACCOUNT_1` | Author has 2–3 total reviews on Google Maps                                           | fake |
| `SHORT_TEXT_EXTREME` | Review text under 20 characters                                                       | fake |
| `SHORT_TEXT` | Review text under 60 characters                                                       | fake |
| `BURST_AFTER_NEGATIVE` | 5★ review within 5 positions after a 1–2★ review                                      | fake |
| `FIVE_STAR_EMPTY` | 5★ rating with text under 50 characters                                               | fake |
| `SURNAME_REPEAT` | Reviewer shares last name with another reviewer in the same set                       | fake |
| `GENERIC_TEXT` | **Absence of specifics** — no repair type, no product, no price, no staff name, no waiting time, no concrete situation described. The review could have been written by someone who was never there. | fake |
| `SUSPICIOUS_NEGATIVE` | 1–2★ review combined with thin account, short text, or generic content | fake |
| `MARKETING_TONE` | **Promotional or exaggerated language** — superlatives, emotional filler with no factual basis: "best ever", "incredible", "world-class", "highly recommend to everyone", "from the bottom of my heart". The review sounds like an ad. | fake |
| `ALL_POSITIVE` | **Only positives, zero negatives or caveats** — the review lists nothing but praise with no minor criticism, no nuance, no "but". Real customers almost always mention at least one small thing that could be better. | fake |
| `EMOJI_SPAM` | Excessive punctuation or decorative emoji with no informational content | fake |
| `TEMPLATE_CLONE` | Phrasing nearly identical to another review in the same set                           | fake |
| `EDITED_REVIEW` | Review was edited after initial posting                                               | real |
| `HAS_PHOTOS` | Review includes attached photos                                                       | real |
| `EXPERIENCED_AUTHOR_5` | Author has more than 5 reviews on Google Maps                                         | real |
| `EXPERIENCED_AUTHOR_10` | Author has more than 10 reviews on Google Maps                                        | real |
| `ACTIVE_PROFILE` | Author has uploaded more than 5 photos to Google Maps                                 | real |
| `LONG_TEXT` | Review text over 400 characters                                                       | real |
| `SPECIFIC_DETAILS` | Mentions specific names, prices, waiting times, or physical details                   | real |
| `BALANCED_TONE` | Review notes both positives and negatives or caveats                                  | real |
| `NATURAL_LANGUAGE` | Informal language, typos, colloquialisms, personal voice                              | real |
| `LOCAL_GUIDE` | Author is a Google-verified Local Guide                                               | real |
| `OWNER_RESPONDED` | The business owner replied to this review                                             | real |
| `HELPFUL_VOTES` | Other users marked this review as helpful                                             | real |
